{"version":1,"content":"<p>中歐貿易談判上周在北京結束，中國財政部及稅務總局今天宣布，明年4月1日起將新能源汽車的增值稅出口退稅率由13%下調至9%，以及取消電子煙設備裝置等產品增值稅出口退稅。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T11:59:20.005310+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:13:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T23:17:38.520032+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:57:38.878593+00:00","content_hash":"ca582a5945018977c2a69f712633401b2e57b9a8d2c476a318dbceaed5144910","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}